 question is . . . what will you ask your guest?", "short_description": "\u201cIf you could have dinner with anyone living or dead, who would it be?\u201d Until now, this has been nothing more than a fun hypothetical to spark conversation. But through mixed reality and artificial intelligence, An Impossible Guest makes the impossible possible. You can now invite a guest from history into your physical space for a one of a kind dinner conversation. So, now that anything is possible, the only question is . . . what will you ask your guest?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://theelectricfactory.com/animpossibleguest/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "The Electric Factory", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://theelectricfactory.com/animpossibleguest", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1009754623701799"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "648200990775289"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "648200990775289"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1717709533, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "648200990775289"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26028973600019763", "version": "0.111"}, "id": "3147804382186703", "channel_name": "LIVE